   ("Admit for IV ceftriaxone, doxycycline and metronidazole", "She meets no admission criteria (temperature below 38.5°C, no abscess, not pregnant, tolerating oral)."),
   ("Kit 2: secnidazole and fluconazole", "Kit 2 treats vaginitis; it does not cover the gonorrhoea, chlamydia and anaerobes that cause PID."),
